{"result":"ok","response":"collection","data":[{"id":"07053359-746d-4217-82e5-add1e2c99239","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"en":"Lychee\u2606Light Club"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u30e9\u30a4\u30c1\u2606\u5149\u30af\u30e9\u30d6"},{"ja-ro":"Litchi\u2606Hikari Club"}],"description":{"en":"A group of nine boys (called the Hikari Club) are intent on making the Ultimate AI. The attractive leader of the club, Zera, is a twisted man polluting the minds of the club members to make them do whatever he pleases. Tamiya, the original founder of the club, wants to reclaim the club. Niko, the second in command, is pissed off at Jaibo, the one obsessed with Zera. They kidnap a schoolgirl, but the AI Raichi falls in love with her and she with him, and things get messy.","pl":"\"Jestem cz\u0142owiekiem. Tak zosta\u0142em zaprogramowany.\"  \nCh\u0142opcy z przemys\u0142owego miasteczka maj\u0105 tylko jeden jasny punkt w \u017cyciu: Hikari Club, sekretne bractwo, kt\u00f3re zorganizowali w porzuconej fabryce. Ich koronnym projektem jest stworzenie \"my\u015bl\u0105cej maszyny\" nap\u0119dzanej owocami liczi. Jednak boja\u017aliwa solidarno\u015b\u0107 gimnazjalist\u00f3w szybko przekszta\u0142ca si\u0119 w nacjonalistyczno-socjalistyczne bagno morderczej paranoi, perwersyjnego estetyzmu i (nie zawsze) t\u0142umionego homoseksualizmu. Club to do tej pory najdoskonalsza praca Usamaru Furuyi. Oto W\u0142adca Much nowego wieku, cho\u0107 to dzie\u0142o nigdy nie zostanie jedn\u0105 z lektur szkolnych."},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"35709","ap":"lychee-light-club","bw":"de2337a02f-1acf-44a4-822c-6da87b8d406a","kt":"12565","mu":"25496","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/4778320174","cdj":"https:\/\/www.cdjapan.co.jp\/product\/NEOBK-369258","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/111261\/","mal":"5709","raw":"https:\/\/www.cmoa.jp\/title\/73057\/","engtl":"https:\/\/kodansha.us\/series\/lychee-light-club\/"},"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"1","lastChapter":"9","publi