Slice of Life"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2019-05-09T02:58:19+00:00","updatedAt":"2024-06-07T18:03:50+00:00","version":13,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["en","ru","pl","fr","id","es-la"],"latestUploadedChapter":"ddeed140-d8bf-43c8-8bbd-9582e8403d63"},"relationships":[{"id":"fe546044-b115-43ee-9ef8-2e2c81e110f7","type":"author"},{"id":"fe546044-b115-43ee-9ef8-2e2c81e110f7","type":"artist"},{"id":"9d7b6a0c-e4fa-4fda-8eba-299f5c528689","type":"cover_art"},{"id":"3e1349bd-ee65-4d2c-9945-da3d577bddd9","type":"manga","related":"same_franchise"},{"id":"4259cfdd-2a81-41aa-91d0-a5d44275d6cc","type":"manga","related":"same_franchise"},{"id":"47775ed0-6023-4e11-a221-a0c1ef0973dc","type":"manga","related":"same_franchise"},{"id":"d52a2ce5-5ea1-4bef-9a0e-58519caaecd8","type":"manga","related":"same_franchise"},{"id":"fe1eb90f-6afd-4765-a186-eb90c64b7341","type":"manga","related":"same_franchise"}]},{"id":"516c4299-9318-48e8-9e84-4bc56b26f6cd","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"en":"Rocket Science Love"},"altTitles":[{"ko":"\ub85c\ucf13 \uc0ac\uc774\uc5b8\uc2a4 \ub7ec\ube0c"}],"description":{"en":"I thought it was just platonic, spending the rest of our lives together as nothing more than friends\u2026 That was until Han Jei broke the news: \u201cSeojin, I\u2019m getting married.\u201d \n\nSeojin, who was adopted to Germany when he was a child, has maintained a 15 year long relationship with Jei. When confronted with the prospect of Jei\u2019s marriage, he realizes he\u2019s in love with him. Working as a pilot, Seojin moves back to Korea in an attempt to run away, but his plan starts to unravel when Jei boards the flight to follow him. The two find themselves living together in Korea as Jei\u2019s wedding date rapidly approaches. \n\n\u201cSeojin, you\u2019re not acting like this because of me, are you?\u201d\n\nAs Seojin tries to push Jei away due to his emerging desires and Jei wishes to rekindle their precious friendship, they spend more time with each other and the tension between them begins to arise\u2026","fr":"\"Je pensais que c'\u00e9tait juste platonique, passer le reste de notre vie ensemble comme de simples amis...\" C'\u00e9tait jusqu'\u00e0 ce que Han Jei annonce la nouvelle : \"Seo Jin, je vais me marier.\" Seo Jin, qui a \u00e9t\u00e9 adopt\u00e9 en Allemagne lorsqu'il \u00e9tait enfant, entretient une relation de 15 ans avec Jei. Lorsqu'il est confront\u00e9 \u00e0 la perspective du mariage de Jei, il se rend compte qu'il est amoureux de lui. Travaillant comme pilote, Seo Jin retourne en Cor\u00e9e pour tenter de s'enfuir, mais son plan commence \u00e0 s'effondrer lorsque Jei monte \u00e0 bord du vol pour le suivre. Les deux se retrouvent \u00e0 vivre ensemble en Cor\u00e9e alors que la date du mariage de Jei approche \u00e0 grands pas. \"Seo Jin, tu n'agis pas comme \u00e7a \u00e0 cause de moi, n'est-ce pas ?\" Alors que Seo Jin essaie de repousser Jei en raison de ses d\u00e9sirs \u00e9mergents et que Jei souhaite raviver leur pr\u00e9cieuse amiti\u00e9, ils passent plus de temps ensemble et la tension entre eux commence \u00e0 surgir...","ko":"\uc6b0\uc815\uc774\ub77c\uace0 \uc0dd\uac01\ud588\ub2e4. \uac00\uc7a5 \uac00\uae4c\uc6b4 \uacf3\uc5d0\uc11c \ud3c9\uc0dd\uc744 \ud568\uaed8\ud560, ...\uadf8\ub0e5 \uce5c\uad6c. \"\uc11c\uc9c4\uc544, \ub098 \uacb0\ud63c\ud574.\" \ud55c\uc7ac\uc774\uac00 \uccad\ucc9c\ubcbd\ub825 \uac19\uc740 \uc18c\uc2dd\uc744 \uc804\ud558\uae30 \uc804\uae4c\uc9c0\ub294. \uc5b4\ub9b0 \uc2dc\uc808 \ub3c5\uc77c\ub85c \uc785\uc591\ub418\uc5b4 \uc7ac\uc774\uc640 15\ub144\uac04 \uc6b0\uc815\uc744 \uc9c0\ucf1c\uc628 \uc11c\uc9c4. \uadf8\uc758 \uacb0\ud63c\uc774\ub77c\ub294 \ud604\uc2e4\uacfc \ub9de\ub2e5\ub728\ub9ac\uace0\uc11c\uc57c \uc7ac\uc774\uc5d0 \ub300\ud55c \uac10\uc815\uc774 \uc0ac\ub791\uc774\uc5c8\uc74c\uc744 \uae68\ub2eb\uac8c \ub41c\ub2e4. \ud56d\uacf5\uc0ac \uae30\uc7a5\uc73c